---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="fiscal" class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-blue-50/40 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 font-semibold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-5">
        <Icon name="FileBadge" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Diferencial fiscal
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5 tracking-tight text-balance">
        NFS-e e <span class="text-blue-600">Receita Saúde</span> sem sair do sistema
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Pare de pagar contador pra emitir nota uma a uma e de montar planilha pro Carnê-Leão. O sistema gera, assina e entrega — você só confirma.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <!-- NFS-e Card -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 p-8 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600">
            <Icon name="FileBadge" class="w-6 h-6" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">NFS-e Nacional</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Padrão Receita Federal</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Certificado digital A1 (PKCS#12) integrado</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Código de serviço 04.16 (psicologia) pré-configurado</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Geração de DPS, assinatura XML e transmissão automática</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Suporte a Simples Nacional e regime normal</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>XML armazenado e PDF gerado pra enviar ao paciente</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/recursos/nfs-e-psicologia" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">
          Ver detalhes da NFS-e
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Receita Saúde Card -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 p-8 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600">
            <Icon name="Receipt" class="w-6 h-6" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Receita Saúde</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Carnê-Leão e-CAC</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>CSV oficial conforme Manual v2.1 (16 campos, ;)</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Código de ocupação 255 (psicólogo) padronizado</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Lotes de até 1.000 linhas por arquivo, com paginação automática</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Workflow guiado: rascunho → gerado → enviado → confirmado</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>Pronto pra importar direto no e-CAC, sem ajuste manual</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/recursos/receita-saude" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">
          Ver detalhes da Receita Saúde
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
